            <profile id="0f00-27f4-f44e-eda8" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="b792-78e1-7b03-d4d6" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a hand weapon and compound bow. May have a shield (+2 pts), axe (+2 pts) and light armour (+3 pts). May ride a horse (free; Movement 8"). Army Standard Bearer. (The Art of War p.32)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="8c97-0d01-7f5c-a87a" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
