              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a hand weapon and rocks (range 4", Strength 3). In situations where they needed to defend their homes or flocks, the tribespeople would have been capable of defending themselves. (The Art of War p.32)</characteristic>
